sgp 2

given
  a = 5
  b = 3
  t = 35
  e1 = ellipse(O)
    a1: a(e1) = a
    b1: b(e1) = b

construct
  point A on e1
    x_A: x(A) = a*cos(t°)

find
  y_A: y(A)

where
  e1 a 5 b 3 angle 0° [fixed angle]
  A (4.095760221444959, 1.7207293090531384)
  a1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  b1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  x_A label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_A label (0.3, 0.3)
